Z||000023||fieroX||12-11-2001||03:45 AM||||Ok heres the deal.  Right now I am deeply involved in a 3800 SC swap, but as soon as everything is finished under the decklid, im moving my efforts into the interior area.  (If you saw my car you would know why)  Im hoping for Late spring/early summer starting a plug for a custom dash, console and door panels.  Everything will follow the theme of the other.  The dash will flow into the door panels at the edges, and the console will flow into the dash at the middle.  I have a concept that is in my head, and nobody can steal it.  Its not going to be like anything ever seen before, but I can tell you that if you like the interiors seen in this thread, you will love my idea.  Just kick back for awhile, dont go spend $1500 on a custom dash or anything, be patient, and Ill let everyone know how things are coming along, after my L67 project is finished!<P>------------------<BR>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fierox.com/logo2small.gif">  </A><BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroX.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroX.com</A><BR>coming soon L67 powered 87 coupe||||reg||1
